        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "# Explore Healthcare Care Pathways",
          "",
          "Healthcare events become easier to review when the relationships between a patient journey, condition, care gap, encounter, treatment, care team, provider, and quality signal remain visible. This notebook uses the loader-created `CARE_PATHWAY_GRAPH` property graph over the same governed relational data.",
          "",
          "Run the paragraphs from top to bottom. SQL tables provide repeatable evidence, while the graph visualizations show the paths that explain the result. All patient journeys and clinical details are synthetic and de-identified workshop data."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "## Exercise 1: Trace a patient journey through connected care",
          "",
          "Begin with **Patient 1001 - Sepsis Readmission Risk** and follow one or two outgoing relationships. The table returns each distinct care fact reached from that journey.",
          "",
          "**What to look for:** Follow the journey to the sepsis condition, readmission care gap, and inpatient encounter. From there, continue to the quality signal, follow-up action, care team, medication, and provider."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 0,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT DISTINCT journey_id,",
          "       connected_node_id,",
          "       connected_node,",
          "       connected_type,",
          "       connected_risk",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "  LLUSER.care_pathway_graph",
          "  MATCH (journey IS care_node)",
          "        -[relationship IS care_relationship]->{1,2}",
          "        (connected IS care_node)",
          "  WHERE journey.node_type = 'PATIENT_JOURNEY'",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    journey.node_id AS journey_id,",
          "    connected.node_id AS connected_node_id,",
          "    connected.node_label AS connected_node,",
          "    connected.node_type AS connected_type,",
          "    connected.risk_score AS connected_risk",
          "  )",
          ")",
          "ORDER BY connected_risk DESC,",
          "         connected_node_id;"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "table",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "### Visualize the same pathway",
          "",
          "Run the next paragraph as a graph visualization. Select a vertex to inspect its node ID, label, type, risk score, and pathway volume."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 0,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT *",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "  LLUSER.care_pathway_graph",
          "  MATCH (journey IS care_node)",
          "        -[relationship IS care_relationship]->{1,2}",
          "        (connected IS care_node)",
          "  WHERE journey.node_type = 'PATIENT_JOURNEY'",
          "  ONE ROW PER STEP (from_node, traversed_edge, to_node)",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    VERTEX_ID(journey) AS journey_id,",
          "    VERTEX_ID(from_node) AS from_node_id,",
          "    EDGE_ID(traversed_edge) AS relationship_id,",
          "    VERTEX_ID(to_node) AS connected_node_id",
          "  )",
          ");"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "visualization",
        "visualizationConfig": "[{\"visualization\":{\"height\":455,\"ruleBasedStyles\":[{\"stylingEnabled\":true,\"visibilityEnabled\":true,\"target\":\"edge\",\"conditions\":{\"operator\":\"and\",\"conditions\":[{\"property\":\"labels\",\"operator\":\"CONTAINS\",\"value\":\"CARE_RELATIONSHIP\"}]},\"component\":\"edge\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#8B8580\"},\"legendTitle\":\"CARE_RELATIONSHIP\",\"isDefaultRule\":true},{\"stylingEnabled\":true,\"visibilityEnabled\":true,\"target\":\"vertex\",\"conditions\":{\"operator\":\"and\",\"conditions\":[{\"property\":\"labels\",\"operator\":\"CONTAINS\",\"value\":\"CARE_NODE\"}]},\"component\":\"vertex\",\"properties\":{\"label\":{\"text\":\"${properties['NODE_LABEL']}\",\"color\":\"black\",\"font\":{\"size\":14}}},\"style\":{\"color\":\"#8FBFD0\",\"label\":{\"text\":\"${properties['NODE_LABEL']}\",\"color\":\"black\",\"font\":{\"size\":14}}},\"legendTitle\":\"CARE_NODE\",\"isDefaultRule\":true}],\"displaySizeOnLoad\":14,\"lastColumns\":[\"JOURNEY_ID\",\"FROM_NODE_ID\",\"RELATIONSHIP_ID\",\"CONNECTED_NODE_ID\"],\"version\":11}}]",
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "## Exercise 2: Trace the evidence behind a quality signal",
          "",
          "The next pattern narrows the graph to two-step paths that begin with a patient journey and end at a quality signal. The middle node shows the condition or care gap that connects the journey to that signal.",
          "",
          "**What to look for:** The journey reaches **Central Line Infection Risk** through both **Sepsis** and **Readmission Risk**, giving the care team two evidence paths to review."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 0,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT journey,",
          "       clinical_context,",
          "       context_type,",
          "       quality_signal,",
          "       first_relationship,",
          "       second_relationship,",
          "       first_evidence_score,",
          "       second_evidence_score",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "  LLUSER.care_pathway_graph",
          "  MATCH (journey IS care_node)",
          "        -[first_step IS care_relationship]->",
          "        (clinical_context IS care_node)",
          "        -[second_step IS care_relationship]->",
          "        (quality_signal IS care_node)",
          "  WHERE journey.node_type = 'PATIENT_JOURNEY'",
          "    AND quality_signal.node_type = 'QUALITY_SIGNAL'",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    journey.node_label AS journey,",
          "    clinical_context.node_label AS clinical_context,",
          "    clinical_context.node_type AS context_type,",
          "    quality_signal.node_label AS quality_signal,",
          "    first_step.relationship_type AS first_relationship,",
          "    second_step.relationship_type AS second_relationship,",
          "    first_step.evidence_score AS first_evidence_score,",
          "    second_step.evidence_score AS second_evidence_score",
          "  )",
          ")",
          "ORDER BY clinical_context;"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "table",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "### Visualize the quality-signal evidence paths",
          "",
          "Run the final SQL paragraph to compare the two routes from the patient journey to the quality signal. Select an edge to inspect its relationship type and evidence score."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 0,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT *",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "  LLUSER.care_pathway_graph",
          "  MATCH (journey IS care_node)",
          "        -[first_step IS care_relationship]->",
          "        (clinical_context IS care_node)",
          "        -[second_step IS care_relationship]->",
          "        (quality_signal IS care_node)",
          "  WHERE journey.node_type = 'PATIENT_JOURNEY'",
          "    AND quality_signal.node_type = 'QUALITY_SIGNAL'",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    VERTEX_ID(journey) AS journey_id,",
          "    EDGE_ID(first_step) AS first_step_id,",
          "    VERTEX_ID(clinical_context) AS context_id,",
          "    EDGE_ID(second_step) AS second_step_id,",
          "    VERTEX_ID(quality_signal) AS signal_id",
          "  )",
          ");"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "visualization",
        "visualizationConfig": "[{\"visualization\":{\"height\":455,\"ruleBasedStyles\":[{\"stylingEnabled\":true,\"visibilityEnabled\":true,\"target\":\"edge\",\"conditions\":{\"operator\":\"and\",\"conditions\":[{\"property\":\"labels\",\"operator\":\"CONTAINS\",\"value\":\"CARE_RELATIONSHIP\"}]},\"component\":\"edge\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#8B8580\"},\"legendTitle\":\"CARE_RELATIONSHIP\",\"isDefaultRule\":true},{\"stylingEnabled\":true,\"visibilityEnabled\":true,\"target\":\"vertex\",\"conditions\":{\"operator\":\"and\",\"conditions\":[{\"property\":\"labels\",\"operator\":\"CONTAINS\",\"value\":\"CARE_NODE\"}]},\"component\":\"vertex\",\"properties\":{\"label\":{\"text\":\"${properties['NODE_LABEL']}\",\"color\":\"black\",\"font\":{\"size\":14}}},\"style\":{\"color\":\"#8FBFD0\",\"label\":{\"text\":\"${properties['NODE_LABEL']}\",\"color\":\"black\",\"font\":{\"size\":14}}},\"legendTitle\":\"CARE_NODE\",\"isDefaultRule\":true}],\"displaySizeOnLoad\":14,\"lastColumns\":[\"JOURNEY_ID\",\"FIRST_STEP_ID\",\"CONTEXT_ID\",\"SECOND_STEP_ID\",\"SIGNAL_ID\"],\"version\":11}}]",
