          "%md",
          "## Conclusion",
          "",
          "You used SQL/PGQ to produce repeatable pathway evidence and Graph Studio to inspect the same relationships visually. The first investigation expanded from one de-identified patient journey into its connected care. The second isolated the two evidence paths that lead to a quality signal so the care team can review why it was connected."
        ],
